@page "/"
<PageTitle>Tangent Atlas</PageTitle>

@* =====================
   Hero
   ===================== *@
<section class="ta-hero">
    <div class="ta-container ta-hero-inner">
        <h1 class="ta-hero-title">Tangent Atlas makes managing all your money — paychecks, bonuses, savings, credit cards, 401(k), investments — <em>as simple as setting a thermostat.</em></h1>

        <div class="ta-hero-grid">
            <div class="ta-hero-copy">
                <p class="ta-hero-lead">Connect your bank, brokerage, credit cards and 401(k), and manage everything you own and owe from one place. Trade a single stock or an entire index with the same ease. Set your rules, and every dollar coming in or going out follows them. Sleep at night knowing you have a plan, and when the storm hits, respond with discipline, not panic.</p>
                <ul class="ta-pains">
                    <li>
                        <span class="ta-pain-question">Bonus sitting in checking?</span>
                        <span class="ta-pain-answer">Pay the cards, top up savings and invest the rest, in the order you choose.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="ta-pain-question">Need cash fast?</span>
                        <span class="ta-pain-answer">Draw down your brokerage without changing the mix you've chosen.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="ta-pain-question">Dividends piling up?</span>
                        <span class="ta-pain-answer">Sweep them to checking automatically.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="ta-pain-question">Love your stocks, but know you should diversify?</span>
                        <span class="ta-pain-answer">Keep your favorites at the percentages you choose and fill the rest with a popular index, rebalanced automatically.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <RulesPanel />
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@* =====================
   How it works
   ===================== *@
<section class="ta-section" id="how">
    <div class="ta-container">
        <div class="ta-eyebrow">How it works</div>
        <ol class="ta-steps">
            <li class="ta-step">
                <div class="ta-step-num">1</div>
                <div class="ta-step-title">Link</div>
                <div class="ta-step-body">Link your accounts. We never see your passwords.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="ta-step">
                <div class="ta-step-num">2</div>
                <div class="ta-step-title">Set</div>
                <div class="ta-step-body">Set your rules, like setting a thermostat.</div>
            </li>
            <li class="ta-step">
                <div class="ta-step-num">3</div>
                <div class="ta-step-title">Relax</div>
                <div class="ta-step-body">Atlas keeps every account the way you set it, in calm markets and rough ones.</div>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>

@* =====================
   Call to action
   ===================== *@
<section class="ta-cta">
    <div class="ta-container ta-cta-inner">
        <h2 class="ta-cta-title">A thermostat for all your money.</h2>
        <p class="ta-cta-sub">Discipline, built in. Keep your bank, your broker and your stocks.</p>
        <AuthorizeView>
            <Authorized>
                <a href="/accounts" class="ta-btn ta-btn-primary ta-btn-large">Go to my accounts</a>
            </Authorized>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <a href="/signup" class="ta-btn ta-btn-primary ta-btn-large">Sign up</a>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </div>
</section>
